2.6 Personal data

    Official documents can name private persons. They are kept as published, except that in gazettes and local
    documents a private person's name or address is replaced inline ([姓名略], [地址略]). A document essentially
    about a private person is kept as metadata only. Court judgments are not in this repository.

3. No warranty

    The texts are copies of the official publications made with care; they are not the official publication. For
    anything that matters, read the official text (each commit names its source page).

